  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project is for the refurbishment and fuel switch . from coal to biomass . of Block VI of P&#xE9;cs power plant.  The Project take places in the context of a complex boiler rehabilitation / fuel-switch operation and will result in one of the biggest renewable generating facility of Central Eastern Europe.</narrative>
  </description>
